invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_ifma_product.h
catches: rsa_ifma_model_test
reason: The product leaves lane 0 of its first register as the rounds
  wrote it rather than digit_zero, the digit with every carry into it, so
  every product's digit 0 and the carry out of it are wrong.
  bin/rsa_ifma_model_test compares rsa_vp1_cpu under the bit with
  rsa_vp1 and each product with rsa_mont64.c's answer.

--- old
    sum[0] = lanes_replace_first(sum[0], digit_zero);
--- new
    (void)digit_zero;
